# 🎯 RynudeCode → Claude Code: Implementation Plan Lengkap (50 Perubahan)

Rencana transformasi RynudeCode agar bekerja **identik** dengan Claude Code asli, dari CLI terminal hingga agentic loop, tool use, permission system, dan UX.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Plan ini disusun berdasarkan **analisis mendalam** terhadap codebase saat ini. Setiap perubahan di-group per komponen arsitektur dan diurutkan berdasarkan prioritas dependensi (yang jadi fondasi dikerjakan duluan).

---

## 📊 Analisis Gap Saat Ini vs Claude Code

| Aspek | RynudeCode Saat Ini | Claude Code Asli |
|-------|-------------------|-----------------|
| **Tools** | 6 tools (list_files, read_file, write_file, edit_file, search_code, web_search) | 15+ tools (bash, grep, glob, read, write, edit, search, notebook, mcp, dll) |
| **Edit Mode** | Simple string replace (`str_replace`) | Unified diff + line-range targeting |
| **Command Execution** | ❌ Tidak ada | ✅ `bash` tool dengan sandbox + timeout |
| **Permission System** | ❌ Tidak ada | ✅ Ask-before-write/execute, auto-approve mode |
| **Grep/Search** | Hanya GitHub code search | `ripgrep` native di filesystem |
| **CLI UX** | Basic prompt loop | Rich TUI: spinner, diff preview, streaming markdown, progress bar |
| **Agent Loop** | Max 8 iterations, no extended thinking | Max 200+ iterations, extended thinking, parallel tool calls |
| **Max Tokens** | Hardcoded 4096 | Dynamic 16384+, extended thinking 32768 |
| **Context Window** | Last 20 messages | Smart summarization + sliding window |
| **System Prompt** | Generic coding persona | Deep workspace-aware, auto-inject AGENTS.md + project context |
| **Slash Commands** | 4 (/help, /clear, /model, /exit) | 15+ (/init, /compact, /cost, /doctor, /bug, /review, dll) |
| **File Watching** | ❌ | ✅ inotify/fswatch integration |
| **Multi-edit** | ❌ Single str_replace | ✅ Multiple chunks per file |
| **Git Integration** | ❌ | ✅ git diff, git status, commit |
| **Cost Tracking** | Basic token estimate | Precise input/output/cache token counting |

