#### [4] [MODIFY] `edit_file` — Multi-chunk Replace dengan Line Numbers

**File:** [AgentTools.php](file:///Users/maya/rynude_ai/app/Services/AI/AgentTools.php), [LocalWorkspaceService.php](file:///Users/maya/rynude_ai/app/Services/LocalWorkspaceService.php)

Saat ini `edit_file` hanya `str_replace` satu kali. Claude Code mendukung:
- `start_line` dan `end_line` targeting
- Multiple replacements dalam satu call
- Diff preview sebelum apply

**Schema baru:**
```php
[
    'name' => 'edit_file',
    'description' => 'Edit a file by replacing specific text. Supports line-range targeting.',
    'input_schema' => [
        'type' => 'object',
        'properties' => [
            'path' => ['type' => 'string'],
            'old_text' => ['type' => 'string', 'description' => 'Exact text to find (must match including whitespace)'],
            'new_text' => ['type' => 'string', 'description' => 'Replacement text'],
            'start_line' => ['type' => 'integer', 'description' => 'Optional: narrow search to lines from this number'],
            'end_line' => ['type' => 'integer', 'description' => 'Optional: narrow search to lines up to this number'],
        ],
        'required' => ['path', 'old_text', 'new_text'],
    ],
]
```

